      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The page's own second screen, quoted as it is. #app=true\nskips its Support SimpleX, which the app has just shown.\nNEW on the page: read that flag, start here, and remember it\nthrough the flow. The app builds the URL, so it can also say\nwhich kind of app it is - better than the page guessing from\nthe user agent (see lane C).",
