      "y": 920,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 66,
      "strokeColor": "#6b7280",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "roughness": 0,
      "groupIds": [
        "A5",
        "lane1"
      ],
      "seed": 1513,
      "text": "Replaces codeIssued when #app=true. The code is still\nminted and still saved in the browser, so Show code\nrecovers it if the link fails. simplexchat: is a scheme of its\nown, registered everywhere including mobile, so a badge link\ncan never be read as a connection link. Whether a browser\nwill follow it with no tap is the open question.",
      "fontSize": 9,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "autoResize": true,
