      "originalText": "Replaces codeIssued when #app=true. The code is still\nminted and still saved in the browser, so Show code\nrecovers it if the link fails. simplexchat: is a scheme of its\nown, registered everywhere including mobile, so a badge link\ncan never be read as a connection link. Whether a browser\nwill follow it with no tap is the open question.",
