      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "roughness": 0,
      "groupIds": [
        "A6",
        "lane1"
      ],
      "seed": 1613,
      "text": "The deep link lands here, not on Redeem code: a pasted code\nand a QR scanner make no sense when the code arrived by\nlink. It calls the existing apiRedeemBadgeCode and shows its\nfailures as that screen does. Naming: Redeeming code names\nthe mechanism, Badge is being issued names the outcome -\nand the outcome is what the buyer cares about.",
      "fontSize": 9,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "a07c",
