      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Two of these are states on BadgeState, not alerts: Paid, which\nthe worker retries, and Waiting, which holds nothing but the\nslot - Support SimpleX must not offer a second purchase of a\nconsumable. Both resolve through the store, not the service:\nTransaction.updates on iOS, queryPurchasesAsync on Play,\nwhich is also how each is re-found after a restart.",
      "lineHeight": 1.2222222222222223
