      "text": "On desktop, Buy in browser opens the page and this screen\ntogether, so the code has somewhere to go the moment it\nappears. No new screen, no deep link, no A6 - the shipped\nflow, with one extra window. It is also the honest fallback for\nany platform where the scheme turns out not to work.",
