      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "codeIssued as it ships, with one line changed. The app builds\nthe URL, so #app=desktop is a fact rather than a guess -\nbetter than sniffing the user agent, which cannot tell a\ndesktop browser opened by SimpleX from any other. Mobile\ngets #app=true and the A5 screen instead.",
      "lineHeight": 1.4666666666666666
    },
    {
      "id": "q-box",
