      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Copy is quoted from the app and the page. The app's screens take the page's names: Your level becomes Choose your badge, the level name becomes How long?, and Check your order is shared already.\nStore prices are illustrative and come from the storefront; the page's prices are the shipped catalog. Not drawn: the page's refusals - no active price, a provider unavailable, too many attempts - which are unchanged and already built.",
      "lineHeight": 1.3
    }
